---
import RolePage from '../../components/pages/RolePage.astro';
---

<RolePage
  lang="en"
  title="For access & events — Rondo"
  description="Rondo for gate volunteers and event teams: digital membership passes and a scanner in the webapp."
  kicker="For your role"
  roleTitle="Access & events"
  intro="Check membership quickly and clearly. Rondo uses digital membership passes and a built-in scanner, so at the gate you immediately know where things stand."
  demoLabel="Look at the demo"
  contactLabel="Contact us"
  contactHref="/en/contact/"
  screenshotSrc="/screenshot-ledenpas-apple-awc.webp"
  screenshotAlt="Digital AWC membership pass in Apple Wallet"
  screenshotWidth={1206}
  screenshotHeight={1637}
  secondaryScreenshotSrc="/screenshot-ledenpas-scanner-awc.webp"
  secondaryScreenshotAlt="Scanner for the digital AWC membership pass"
  secondaryScreenshotWidth={1206}
  secondaryScreenshotHeight={2052}
  screenshotLayout="passWide"
  whatHeading="What this solves"
  bulletPoints={[
    'No paper lists or manual name lookups at the entrance.',
    'Members add their available digital membership pass to Apple Wallet or Google Wallet directly from My details.',
    'When someone has several current roles, they choose exactly which role appears on the pass.',
    'A sponsor contact who is also a member with a current volunteer role can choose between the sponsor pass and an AWC pass carrying that role.',
    'Every scan checks the exact pass type, current entitlement and pass version online.',
    'When a relevant member or sponsor-pass entitlement changes, previously issued QR codes remain revoked; reactivation requires a new pass.',
    'Sponsors get a pass too: scanning shows the company right away — handy at Businessclub evenings.',
  ]}
  cards={[
    { title: 'Faster throughput', text: 'Fewer queues through rapid validation on mobile or laptop in the webapp.' },
    { title: 'The right pass', text: 'Members with several current roles choose the pass that fits the occasion.' },
    { title: 'Current validity', text: 'The scanner checks current entitlements and never accepts an old revoked QR code again.' },
  ]}
  otherHeading="Other paths"
  otherPrefix="Also relevant:"
  otherAnd="and"
  otherLinks={[
    { href: '/en/for-sponsor-committee/', label: 'For the sponsor committee' },
    { href: '/en/for-treasurer/', label: 'For treasurers' },
  ]}
  hasExtra={true}
>
  <div class="pass-lifecycle-block role-container">
    <div class="pass-lifecycle-copy">
      <h2 class="gradient-text pass-lifecycle-heading">The right pass, with current validity</h2>
      <p>
        In My details, a member with several current roles first chooses which digital pass to add to Apple Wallet or Google
        Wallet. A sponsor contact who also has regular membership and a current role can choose the sponsor pass or
        an AWC pass carrying that role.
      </p>
      <p>
        The QR code records the selected pass type. At every scan, Rondo checks online whether that exact entitlement
        is still active and whether the pass version is current. A relevant change permanently invalidates older QR
        codes; reactivation does not restore an old code.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="pass-lifecycle-shot">
      <img
        class="zoomable-screenshot"
        src="/screenshot-lidpas-rolkeuze.jpg"
        alt="Choosing from current roles before adding a digital membership pass to Apple Wallet or Google Wallet"
        width="384"
        height="606"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
</RolePage>

<style>
  .pass-lifecycle-block {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .pass-lifecycle-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.72fr; }
  }

  .pass-lifecycle-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .pass-lifecycle-copy p {
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .pass-lifecycle-shot {
    max-width: 24rem;
    justify-self: center;
    border: 1px solid #D8E3EE;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 27, 96, 0.16);
  }

  .pass-lifecycle-shot img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
